    // Skill lists, from chapter 06 (Skills). The attribute for each skill is
    // its `attr`, or its name in lower case with spaces replaced by "-";
    // specialisations use lower case with "_". Any change here must be mirrored
    // in src/js/sheetworkers.js (sl.skills / sl.specialisations /
    // sl.repeating_skills) and src/scss/_abstracts.scss ($skills /
    // $specialisations); `npm run check` verifies that they agree.
    //
    // "shown" lists the specialisations displayed on a new sheet; players
    // toggle the rest from the skill's settings cog. "forced: 1" keeps a list
    // of extra specialisation rows as well as the fixed ones, so career
    // entries such as "Melee (Brawling)" still find a row.
    //
    // Skills marked "pending" are used by careers (05) but not defined in 06;
    // they are kept on their usual WFRP characteristic (see NOTES-rules-gaps.md).
